# Per-environment bundle values are NOT committed — the repo is a template. CI supplies them as --var
# from GitHub Actions repository *variables* (they're non-secret names), and setup.sh writes a local
# config.yml for manual runs. See README "How CI/CD gets its values" + .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
